  "notes": "RELATED TRANSLATION TERMS:\n- {和訳|わやく}: Japanese translation (translating into Japanese)\n- {翻訳|ほんやく}: translation (general term, any language pair)\n- {通訳|つうやく}: interpretation (spoken translation)\n- {直訳|ちょくやく}: literal translation\n- {意訳|いやく}: free/liberal translation\n\nUSAGE:\n{英訳|えいやく} specifically means translating into English. It can be used as a noun ({英訳|えいやく}を{読|よ}む, to read the English translation) or as a verb with する ({英訳|えいやく}する, to translate into English).",
